  "summary_md": "**Factory ([@FactoryAI](https://x.com/FactoryAI/status/2115934579446182213))** introduces **Droid 1.0**, its new agent engine, which beats models' native harnesses on Terminal-Bench 4 with up to 20% better efficiency and defaults to programmatic tool calling: the model writes a program that runs many tools per request, so a 151-issue Linear migration went from ~36 requests and 3.1M input tokens to 2 requests and 61K tokens ([blog](https://factory.com/news/frontier-harness)).",
